{"id": "3326527", "name": "שטח תחום פולרי – גבול רדיאלי תלוי בזווית (למניסקטה)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהי</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle D=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb{R}^2\\mid x^4+2x^2y^2+y^4\\le{{CT:0}}xy,\\ x\\ge0,\\ y\\ge0\\right\\}\\)</p><p>חשבו את שטח התחום. בקואורדינטות קוטביות נכתוב</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle \\operatorname{Area}(D)=\\int_{\\theta_1}^{\\theta_2}\\int_{r_1(\\theta)}^{r_2(\\theta)}r\\,dr\\,d\\theta\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>הזינו את הגבולות ואת השטח</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle \\theta_1=\\) [[input:ans1]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle \\theta_2=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle r_1(\\theta)=\\) [[input:ans3]] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \\(\\displaystyle r_2(\\theta)=\\) [[input:ans4]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">בתיבות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle r_1,r_2\\)</span> ניתן להשתמש ב־<code dir=\"ltr\">theta</code>.</p><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-root\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: שורש ריבועי – <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(...)</code>, למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(5*x)</code>. שורש מסדר אחר – כחזקה, עם סוגריים סביב המעריך: את \\(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">(x+1)^(1/3)</code>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\displaystyle \\operatorname{Area}(D)=\\) [[input:ans5]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בקואורדינטות קוטביות אי-השוויון הופך לחסם על <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r\\)</span> שתלוי בזווית (עלה של למניסקטה); מחשבים את השטח כאינטגרל של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — המעבר לקואורדינטות קוטביות</b><br><p>נציב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x=r\\cos\\theta,\\ y=r\\sin\\theta\\)</span>. אגף שמאל הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x^2+y^2)^2\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle r^4\\)</span>, ואגף ימין הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}r^2\\cos\\theta\\sin\\theta\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}r^2\\sin(2\\theta)\\)</span>.</p><p>לכן (עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r&gt;0\\)</span>, מחלקים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r^2\\)</span>) התנאי הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r^2\\le {{CT:1}}\\sin(2\\theta)\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r\\le {{CT:2}}\\sqrt{\\sin(2\\theta)}\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הגבולות</b><br><p>התנאים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\ge0,\\ y\\ge0\\)</span> הם הרביע הראשון, ובו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sin(2\\theta)\\ge 0\\)</span>. ברביע הראשון מתקבל</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle 0\\le\\theta\\le\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\qquad 0\\le r\\le{{CT:2}}\\sqrt{\\sin(2\\theta)}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — השטח</b><br><p>האינטגרל הפנימי הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_0^{{{CT:2}}\\sqrt{\\sin(2\\theta)}}r\\,dr=\\frac{{{CT:1}}}{2}\\sin(2\\theta)\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin(2\\theta)\\,d\\theta=1\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(\\displaystyle \\operatorname{Area}(D)=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^{{{CT:2}}\\sqrt{\\sin(2\\theta)}}r\\,dr\\,d\\theta={{CT:3}}\\)</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 12, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "theta", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 16, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if is(equal(ans1,th1)) and is(equal(ans2,th2)) and is(equal(ans3,r1)) and is(equal(ans4,r2)) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>הגבולות — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>הגבולות — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans5", "tans": "val", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>השטח — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>השטח — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "a2", "coef", "r1", "r2", "th1", "th2", "val"], "nvariants": 4}